|align="left"|{{fba|SCO}}||DF/MF||1976–1990|| 672 ||48||<ref group="note">[[Roy Aitken]] made 672 appearances for Celtic in major competitions during his 14 years at Celtic Park.  He also captained the club to a league and cup double in their centenary year of 1988.</ref><ref>{{cite news|title=Aitken senses appetite for battle|url=http://www.express.co.uk/sport/othersport/24758/Aitken-senses-appetite-for-battle|accessdate=8 March 2017|work=The Express|date=10 November 2007}}</ref>
